2026-10-21  Andrew Stubbs  <ams@baylibre.com>

	* gcc.target/gcn/simt-asm-g-1.c: New test, checking that a "g" asm
	operand can hold a per-lane value in SIMT mode.
	* gcc.target/gcn/simt-asm-r-1.c: New test, likewise for an "r" asm
	operand.
	* gcc.target/gcn/simt-avgpr-spill-int.c: New test, checking that
	spills inside a SIMT region go to the AVGPRs rather than through
	v_readlane.
	* gcc.target/gcn/simt-avgpr-spill-double.c: New test.
	* gcc.target/gcn/simt-avgpr-spill-long.c: New test.
	* gcc.target/gcn/simt-avgpr-spill-short.c: New test.
	* gcc.target/gcn/simt-avgpr-spill-run.c: New test, checking that the
	values spilled by simt-avgpr-spill-int.c keep their per-lane values
	across a spill/reload.

